ream","pt":"era só um sonho"}]},{"t":"drill","min":2,"frame":"In the end, {1}.","cues":[{"en":"she found her way","pt":"ela achou o caminho"},{"en":"they became friends","pt":"eles ficaram amigos"},{"en":"everyone was happy","pt":"todos ficaram felizes"},{"en":"he learned a lesson","pt":"ele aprendeu uma lição"},{"en":"they went home","pt":"eles foram para casa"},{"en":"it was only a dream","pt":"era só um sonho"}]},{"t":"odd","min":1,"items":[{"opts":["beginning","end","table","middle"],"ans":2},{"opts":["girl","robot","eat","city"],"ans":2}]},{"t":"curious","min":1,"title":"Escritores famosos","text":"J. K. Rowling escreveu Harry Potter em cafés de Edimburgo. Roald Dahl escrevia em uma cabana no jardim. Muitos autores começam escrevendo uma frase por dia. Você também pode!","kind":"Curiosidade"},{"t":"read","min":3,"title":"Bip the robot","text":"Once upon a time, a little robot named Bip lived in a big city. One night he got lost and could not find his home. He was sad and afraid. Suddenly a girl saw him and said, \"Don't worry. I'll help you.\" They walked together until they found the robot factory. Bip was happy, and the girl too.","pt":"Um robô perdido é ajudado por uma menina a voltar para casa.","qs":[{"q":"Como o robô se sente?","opts":["Angry","Sad and afraid","Happy"],"ans":1},{"q":"Quem o ajuda?","opts":["A man","A girl","A dog"],"ans":1}]},{"t":"cloze","min":2,"text":"Once {{upon}} a time, a little robot {{named}} Bip lived in a big city. One night he got {{lost}} and could not find his home. He was sad and {{afraid}}. Suddenly a girl saw him and said, \"{{Don't}} worry. I'll help you.\" They {{walked}} together until they found the robot factory. Bip was happy, and the girl too.","bank":["walked","Don't","upon","lost","afraid","named"]},{"t":"mcq","min":1,"title":"Como se diz em inglês?","items":[{"q":"Quem é o personagem principal?","opts":["Who is the main character?","Once upon a time...","In the end..."],"ans":0,"say":null},{"q":"Onde a história acontece?","opts":["How does it end?","Suddenly...","Where does the story happen?"],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"Qual é o problema?","opts":["In the end...","What is the problem?","Who is the main character?"],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"Como termina?","opts":["Where does the story happen?","Who is the main character?","How does it end?"],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"Era uma vez...","opts":["Once upon a time...","What a great story!","Who is the main character?"],"ans":0,"say":null},{"q":"De repente...","opts":["In the end...","Once upon a time...","Suddenly..."],"ans":2,"say":null}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"dict","min":2,"items":["What is the problem?","How does it end?","Once upon a time...","A little robot named Bip."]},{"t":"write","min":3,"prompt":"Escreva sua história curta de 10 frases com título.","frame":"Title: ... Once upon a time ... One day ... Suddenly ... In the end ...","words":["character","setting","plot","problem","solution","beginning","middle","end"]},{"t":"speak","min":3,"task":"Leitura da história: cada aluno lê sua história e a turma dá 2 elogios e 1 sugestão.","hints":["Who is the main character?","Where does the story happen?","What is the problem?","How does it end?"]},{"t":"game","min":2,"title":"Jogo rápido","items":[{"q":"end","opts":["Como termina?","fim","imaginar","meio"],"ans":1,"say":"end"},{"q":"Quem é o personagem principal?","opts":["character","Who is the main character?","What is the problem?","Once upon a time..."],"ans":1},{"q":"How does it end?","opts":["Como termina?","enredo","meio","cenário"],"ans":0,"say":"How does it end?"},{"q":"No final...","opts":["Where does the story happen?","imagine","In the end...","middle"],"ans":2},{"q":"setting","opts":["No final...","Como termina?","cenário","fim"],"ans":2,"say":"setting"},{"q":"solução","opts":["solution","What a great story!","How does it end?","What is the problem?"],"ans":0},{"q":"end","opts":["Onde a história acontece?","De repente...","fim","Era uma vez..."],"ans":2,"say":"end"},{